WEBVTT

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:31.616
You can manage many ideas like this,

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:36.296
either in physical boxes
or in their digital equivalents.

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.576
So, I would like to urge you

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.920
to embrace the art
of slow-motion multitasking.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:44.776
Not because you're in a hurry,

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:47.840
but because you're in no hurry at all.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:52.056
And I want to give you one final example,

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:54.216
my favorite example.

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.440
Charles Darwin.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:12:00.896
A man whose slow-burning
multitasking is so staggering,